category: Text
build-depends: cygport libicu-devel liblttoolbox-devel utf8cpp-devel
sdesc: "Lexicon compiler for non-suffixational morphologies"
ldesc: "This module compiles lexicons in a format loosely based on hfst-lexc and
produces transducers in ATT format which are equivalent to those produced
using the overgenerate-and-constrain approach with hfst-twolc."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/apertium/lexd
